# Logs
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

node_modules
dist
dist-ssr
*.local
*.tsbuildinfo

# Fetched by scripts/fetch-media-binaries.mjs — real ffmpeg/fpcalc binaries
# for bundling, never committed. The directory itself has to survive a fresh
# checkout though: tauri.conf.json's bundle.resources references it, and
# tauri_build::build() (src-tauri/build.rs) resolves that path unconditionally
# at build time — even for `cargo clippy`/`cargo build`, not just a real
# `tauri build` bundle — so a genuinely missing directory fails the build
# outright ("resource path `binaries` doesn't exist"), confirmed on every
# platform in CI. .gitkeep tracks the empty directory without tracking its
# real (gitignored) contents.
src-tauri/binaries/*
!src-tauri/binaries/.gitkeep

.claude/

